{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DPh0qQLJEd1794924645.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>兩間二手名牌寄賣店懷疑拖欠寄賣品及款項失聯，涉及至少43人，合共逾1,660萬元。</p><p></p><p>警方指案件，涉及銅鑼灣羅素街26號一間樓上店，及金鐘夏慤道一間店舖，懷疑分別拖欠寄賣款項，1,400萬元及260萬元。有自稱受害人的市民在網上指，涉及的是「樂星」及「VOOTIC」店。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FRAUD-2100-1_CLEAN_20261117_214648.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XecYF36xen1794924655.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>據了解，有受害人發現寄存的貨物售出後，未有收到相關款項，店舖已倒閉，而未售出的貨物亦不翼而飛，負責人又聯絡不上，於是報警。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FRAUD-2100-1_CLEAN_20261117_214648_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026yzTYZMEB2Q1794924667.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方暫時將案件列作「欺詐」處理，交由重案組跟進。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.567768+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":221,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:22:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.322999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:28:52.894524+00:00","content_hash":"d7c344b23f48b87f89b079ce676b80729794d25c1a71a374be64544c900a436f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:35:32.567768+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}